3. *p compared with an address, p a register char ** from &arr[i]  [FIXED]
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
FIXED 2026-08-15, commit 0c89980.  Needed ASSIGN,DEREF,SYMREF,REGVAR -
a symbol's address stored through a register pointer.  The INHL and
